{
    "spec_version": "v1.18",
    "identifier": "RP-AXE-deps",
    "name": "RP-AXE: all dependencies (metapackage)",
    "abstract": "The author's complete RP-AXE development environment as ONE hard-dependency set: every module RP-AXE.netkan lists under depends/recommends/suggests (High graphics included), so a clean CKAN instance reproduces the test install verbatim. Players normally install RP-AXE itself and choose graphics at the prompts. SCANsat is deliberately absent here (the dev instance runs a fork); RP-AXE.netkan depends on CKAN SCANsat.",
    "author": [
        "miskoltrans"
    ],
    "version": "1.0.0",
    "kind": "metapackage",
    "license": "CC-BY-NC-SA-4.0",
    "ksp_version_min": "1.12.0",
    "ksp_version_max": "1.12.5",
    "comment": "The complete RP-AXE environment = (everything RP-1-Express installs MINUS RP-1) + the curated expansion modpack. Base = the 91 modules listed through Waterfall (RP-express-minus-RP-1, incl. MakingHistory-DLC + BreakingGround-DLC; 113 depends total, matching the live registry's user-requested set; BetterTimeWarpCont added 2026-08-17, a QoL addition restored after a rebuild dropped it); the 21 part-mods after Waterfall are the curated expansion (CKAN resolves their transitive deps). GRAPHICS = the HIGH preset, ported verbatim from RP-1-ExpressInstall-Graphics-High (Parallax + Parallax-StockTextures, Scatterer + config + sunflare, RSSTextures16K, RSSVE-HR, DistantObject, PlanetShine, CanaveralPads), plus PoodsMilkyWaySkybox (added 2026-07-28, not part of the Express preset -- an AXE addition); it pulls ~8 GB more than the old Low preset (RSSTextures16K REPLACES RSSTextures4096 -- both provide 'RSSTextures' and conflict, so it is a swap, and CanaveralPads drags in KerbalKonstructs + Cape statics). DMagic / NF-Spacecraft / TantaresLV are deliberately excluded (curation drops). SCANsat is deliberately NOT listed here -- we ship our own fork (miskoltrans/SCANsat-GPU, not on CKAN); tools/rebuild-instance.ps1 builds and installs it from C:\\git\\ksp\\SCANsat as a separate step. No version pins. Conflicts with RP-1. Regenerate from the live registry after a rebuild for the exact transitive set. SCATTERER -- do NOT 'simplify' Scatterer-config-default back to Scatterer-config. 'Scatterer-config' is a virtual name provided by 13 modules (planet packs), and CKAN's headless resolver cannot pick a provider without prompting, so from a metapackage's depends it SILENTLY DROPS it and still exits 0 -- verified by A/B on ckan v1.36.4, identical metapackages differing only in that name. The result is a Scatterer with no config.cfg and no planetsList, which renders no atmosphere, ocean or sky at all. 'Scatterer-config-default' has exactly one provider (Scatterer-config), so it resolves unambiguously -- the same reason Scatterer-sunflare-default is used above.",
